Description: Recognize StepBSD as a distribution and reserve pkg updates to it.
 Keep NextBSD trusted for base dependencies. StepBSD repository packages and
 annotated local package files may install base paths; foreign packages retain
 NextBSD's /usr/local and /var restriction. Only StepBSD may supply pkg updates.
Origin: StepBSD
Forwarded: not-needed (distribution policy)

